e-page" href="/archives/"><i class="fa-fw fas fa-archive"></i><span> 时间轴</span></a></div></div><div id="toggle-menu"><span class="site-page"><i class="fas fa-bars fa-fw"></i></span></div></div></nav><div id="post-info"><h1 class="post-title">CSRF</h1><div id="post-meta"><div class="meta-firstline"><span class="post-meta-date"><i class="far fa-calendar-alt fa-fw post-meta-icon"></i><span class="post-meta-label">发表于</span><time class="post-meta-date-created" datetime="2025-02-20T14:31:37.000Z" title="发表于 2025-02-20 22:31:37">2025-02-20</time><span class="post-meta-separator">|</span><i class="fas fa-history fa-fw post-meta-icon"></i><span class="post-meta-label">更新于</span><time class="post-meta-date-updated" datetime="2025-04-23T00:30:17.020Z" title="更新于 2025-04-23 08:30:17">2025-04-23</time></span></div><div class="meta-secondline"><span class="post-meta-separator">|</span><span class="post-meta-pv-cv" id="" data-flag-title=""><i class="far fa-eye fa-fw post-meta-icon"></i><span class="post-meta-label">浏览量:</span><span id="busuanzi_value_page_pv"><i class="fa-solid fa-spinner fa-spin"></i></span></span></div></div></div></header><main class="layout" id="content-inner"><div id="post"><article class="container post-content" id="article-container"><h1 id="CSRF"><a href="#CSRF" class="headerlink" title="CSRF"></a>CSRF</h1><p><strong>原理：</strong><br>是一种利用用户已登录的身份，通过伪造请求在用户不知情的情况下执行非授权操作的漏洞。其核心是<strong>利用浏览器的Cookie自动携带机制</strong>，诱使用户访问恶意页面或资源，向目标网站发送伪造请求。</p>
<p><strong>攻击流程：</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>用户登录目标网站：用户登录后，浏览器会保存会话Cookie</li>
<li>用户访问恶意页面：攻击者构造的恶意页面中包含针对目标网站的请求（如转账、修改密码）</li>
<li>浏览器自动携带Cookie：请求发送时，浏览器会自动附加目标网站的Cookie，目标网站误认为似乎用户合法操作</li>
<li>恶意操作执行：目标网站处理请求，完成攻击者预设的操作（如转账到攻击者账户）</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>满足条件：</strong></p>
<ul>
<li><p>用户处于已认证的状态</p>
</li>
<li><p>目标网站未部署有效的CSRF防护措施</p>
</li>
<li><p>请求参数可预测</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h1 id="CSRF利用"><a href="#CSRF利用" class="headerlink" title="CSRF利用"></a>CSRF利用</h1><p><strong>攻击方式：</strong></p>
<ul>
<li><p>GET请求伪造：通过<code>&lt;img&gt;</code>标签<code>&lt;ifame&gt;</code>的<code>src</code>属性，或恶意链接触发GET请求</p>
<figure class="highlight js"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">&lt;img src=<span class="string">&quot;https://bank.com/transfer?to=attacker&amp;amount=1000&quot;</span> /&gt;  </span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
</li>
<li><p>POST请求伪造：构造隐藏表单，通过js自动提交</p>
<figure class="highlight js"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">&lt;form action=<span class="string">&quot;https://bank.com/transfer&quot;</span> method=<span class="string">&quot;POST&quot;</span>&gt;  </span><br><span class="line">  <span class="language-xml"><span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">input</span> <span class="attr">type</span>=<span class="string">&quot;hidden&quot;</span> <span class="attr">name</span>=<span class="string">&quot;to&quot;</span> <span class="attr">value</span>=<span class="string">&quot;attacker&quot;</span> /&gt;</span></span>  </span><br><span class="line">  <span class="language-xml"><span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">input</span> <span class="attr">type</span>=<span class="string">&quot;hidden&quot;</span> <span class="attr">name</span>=<span class="string">&quot;amount&quot;</span> <span class="attr">value</span>=<span class="string">&quot;1000&quot;</span> /&gt;</span></span>  </span><br><span class="line">&lt;/form&gt;  </span><br><span class="line"><span class="language-xml"><span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">script</span>&gt;</span><span class="language-javascript"><span class="variable language_">document</span>.<span class="property">forms</span>[<span class="number">0</span>].<span class="title function_">submit</span>();</span><span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">script</span>&gt;</span></span>  </span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>
</ul>
<p><strong>常见场景：</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>修改账户信息（邮箱、密码）</li>
<li>触发资金转账或支付</li>
<li>滥用用户权限（社交平台发帖、关注他人）</li>
</ul>
<h1 id="CSRF防御"><a href="#CSRF防御" class="headerlink" title="CSRF防御"></a>CSRF防御</h1><p><strong>CSRF Token:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li><p>原理：服务器生成随机<code>Token</code>，嵌入表单或请求头（如<code>X-CSRF-Token</code>），提交时验证Token合法性</p>
</li>
<li><p>实现：</p>
<figure class="highlight html"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">form</span> <span class="attr">action</span>=<span class="string">&quot;/transfer&quot;</span> <span class="attr">method</span>=<span class="string">&quot;POST&quot;</span>&gt;</span>  </span><br><span class="line">  <span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">input</span> <span class="attr">type</span>=<span class="string">&quot;hidden&quot;</span> <span class="attr">name</span>=<span class="string">&quot;csrf_token&quot;</span> <span class="attr">value</span>=<span class="string">&quot;RANDOM_STRING&quot;</span> /&gt;</span>  </span><br><span class="line"><span class="tag">&lt;/<span class="name">form</span>&gt;</span>  </span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
</li>
<li><p>关键：<code>Token</code>需绑定用户会话，且每次请求更新</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>SameSite Cookie属性</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>设置<code>Cookie</code>的<code>SameSite</code>属性为<code>Strict</code>或<code>Lax</code>，限制跨站请求携带<code>Cookie</code><figure class="highlight html"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">Set-Cookie: SessionID=admin; SameSite=Lax;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<ul>
<li><code>Strict</code>：完全禁止跨站携带<code>Cookie</code></li>
<li><code>Lax</code>：仅允许安全跨站请求（如导航链接的GET请求）</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>验证Referer&#x2F;Origin头：</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>检查请求头中的<code>Referer</code>或<code>Origin</code>字段，确保请求来源合法</li>
<li>局限性：<ul>
<li><code>Referer</code>可能被篡改或缺失（如隐私模式）</li>
<li>需处理例外情况（移动端应用内请求）</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>二次验证：</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>敏感操作需要额外验证（如密码、短信验证码）</li>
</ul>
<h1 id="CSRF绕过"><a href="#CSRF绕过" class="headerlink" title="CSRF绕过"></a>CSRF绕过</h1><p><strong>CSRF Token防护绕过:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Token泄露：<ul>
<li>通过XSS漏洞窃取Token（组合攻击）</li>
<li>若Token出现在URL中，可能被网络嗅探捕获</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>Token固定：若Token未绑定会话或未更新，攻击者可复用固定Token</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>SameSite Cookie绕过:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Lax模式限制：允许GET请求携带<code>Cookie</code>，若目标网站用GET处理敏感操作（如<code>GET /transfer</code>），仍可被利用</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Referer验证绕过:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li><p>空<code>Referer</code>:通过<code>&lt;meta&gt;</code>标签跳转或<code>data：</code>URI触发无Referer请求</p>
<figure class="highlight html"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">meta</span> <span class="attr">http-equiv</span>=<span class="string">&quot;refresh&quot;</span> <span class="attr">content</span>=<span class="string">&quot;0; url=https://bank.com/transfer&quot;</span> /&gt;</span>  </span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
</li>
<li><p>域名欺骗：若验证罗技不严格（仅检查域名部分），可构造子域名或相似域名</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>其他技巧:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li><p><code>JSON CSRF</code>：若接口支持<code>JSON</code>格式且未校验<code>Content-type</code>，可通过表单提交<code>json</code>数据：</p>
